---
.title = "Choosing a transport",
.description = "Choose a pancake transport by the peers involved, the channel they can open, and whether the channel must be encrypted.",
.date = @date("2026-07-22T00:00:00"),
.author = "Jim Isaacs",
.layout = "page.shtml",
